Package: nycdemog
Title: New York City Demographic Data from the Census
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R:
    person("Kieran", "Healy", , "kjhealy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9114-981X"))
Description: County-, tract-, and block-level demographic data for the
    five counties of New York City, derived from the US Census Bureau via
    'tidycensus'. Provides curated tibbles keyed by GEOID and thin
    wrapper functions for fetching custom NYC slices on demand.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
